<title>USA: Mead Corp Q1 shr slips to $0.38, sales up.</title>
<headline>Mead Corp Q1 shr slips to $0.38, sales up.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter Ended			Mar. 30,	  Mar. 3l,</p>
<p>						    1997		 1996</p>
<p> Net sales				   $1,135.7	  $1,067.2</p>
<p> Cost of Products sold			940.5	     863.2</p>
<p>   Gross profit				 195.2	     204.0</p>
<p> Selling and administrative expenses    142.3	     134.9</p>
<p>   Earnings from operations		  52.9		69.1</p>
